1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,805
The Associated Press reports that Meta has agreed to new protections for teenagers after a major legal fight over social media harm.

2
00:00:09,755 --> 00:00:16,623
The rules include tighter age checks, default limits for young users and overnight restrictions.

3
00:00:16,623 --> 00:00:24,873
Critics say the changes are important, but they still question whether platforms have enough incentive to reduce addictive design.

